+		// RSX_AA_CUT_OFFSCREEN=<n> (default 5; 0 = the old rule: any motion above RSX_AA_CUT): the cut measure first
+		// removes a zoom (best-fit scale + shift of the distant points, so an ADS/FOV change or a fast pan with valid
